Recommends: python3-dbus-fast | python3-dbus-next
Description: Python Multi Process Asyncio-based Cooperative Discoverable Services Framework
 pympacds is a D-Bus-native application framework for building modular,
 multi-process, asyncio-based daemons on Linux. Services subclass the
 framework's ProcessBase and communicate over the D-Bus system bus,
 discovering peer services automatically.
